    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i'm not really a doctor so i'm kinda confused lol. u said they \"can\" interact but is it like a big deal or just minor stuff? i've been feeling pretty low and really need to get my protein up to feel better. i feel like avoiding all those things would make my diet way too restrictive. are they actually dangerous or is it just some extra caution?",
